  "description": "Intelligent HTTP response caching for Reliable.HttpClient with two distinct\n      approaches: Generic type-safe caching (CachedHttpClient<T>) for specific response types\n      and Universal caching (HttpClientWithCache) for multi-type scenarios. Features preset-based\n      configuration, automatic memory management, and zero-setup convenience methods.",
  "id": "Reliable.HttpClient.Caching",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-09-18T13:05:43.78Z",
